                    <h3 class="service-card-title">Convenience</h3>
                    <div class="service-card-hover-details">
                        <p class="service-card-desc">Email Marketing is quite convenient; it’s easy to get started with
                            and reach out to multiple people within a particular group by just a click of a button. It’s
                            easy to access and has a convenient call-to-action mechanism embedded in the message.</p>
